      "message": "Give the tab bar room, mend the tag rows, and settle a repository's head\n\nThe tab bar under a repository's name was 42px; it is 48px now, with a\nlittle more room on either side of each tab, so it reads as a bar rather\nthan a line.\n\nA tag in the rail was drawn as a chip: the row carried the class the\nsignal chips use, so every tag row became a 20px inline box and its\ncommit and author spilled over the row below. The row has a class of its\nown now, and its two facts stack beside the tag.\n\nA repository's head put its description and chips on the left and the\nactions on the right, centred against each other, so the buttons hung\nbetween the description and the chips and the block sat 40px under the\ntabs. Now the description is a line of its own, and the chips and the\nactions share one row beneath it, 28px under the tabs, with or without a\ndescription.\n\nChange-Id: Irepohead0171\nTask: t-20mhmr334pp48r9f3b6b4zysz4\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
